#ZACK
(I’m barely through the door, and Angela’s already got that look—like she’s about to drop something on me.)[p]
Morning, Principal Angela. You wanted to see me?[p]
(My gut’s telling me this isn’t about a raise. Here comes trouble.)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

