Sally, tu… sei più della ragazza silenziosa.[p]
Ma questo non può andare oltre.[p]
Torna a casa, ok?[p]
(Sto cercando di essere il bravo ragazzo, ma il mio corpo urla tutt’altro.)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua>0"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
(She’s killing me with this. She’s so vulnerable, but I can’t cross that line. Not again.)[p]
Sally, you’re… you’re more than the quiet girl. [p]
But this can’t go further. [p]
Go home, okay?[p]
(I’m trying to be the good guy, but my body’s screaming something else.)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
